        <p source="#source-10404-10445"><seg source="#source-10404-10445">行春の召させ参らす草鞋かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-10445-10545"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-10445-10505" corresp="#source-10454-10505"><seg source="#source-10445-10454">夏近し</seg></hi><seg source="#source-10505-10545">　　川上に鶯啼きて夏近し</seg></p>
