        <p source="#source-10876-10968"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-10876-10924" corresp="#source-10879-10924"><seg source="#source-10876-10879">雛</seg></hi><seg source="#source-10924-10968">　　　　古雛の衣や薄き夜の市</seg></p>
