        <p source="#source-11003-11041"><seg source="#source-11003-11041">其中にほうこ雛の寒げなり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11041-11073"><seg source="#source-11041-11073">一年や虫糞払ふ雛の衣</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11073-11117"><seg source="#source-11073-11117">地震ふつて雛天上より落ち給ふ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-11155-11256"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-11155-11209" corresp="#source-11161-11209"><seg source="#source-11155-11161">紙鳶</seg></hi><seg source="#source-11209-11256">　　　落ちもせで旋風の中の紙鳶</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-11256-11406" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-11291-11335"><seg source="#source-11291-11335">パチンコや暮れ行く凧のあり所</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11335-11370"><seg source="#source-11335-11370">大凧の静かに下る雨の中</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-11408-11509"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-11408-11462" corresp="#source-11414-11462"><seg source="#source-11408-11414">出代</seg></hi><seg source="#source-11462-11509">　　　出代の下女も祇王と仏かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-11509-11574" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-11530-11574"><seg source="#source-11530-11574">出代りてこゝに小梅の茶店かな</seg></p>
      </div>
