        <p source="#source-11672-11776"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-11672-11726" corresp="#source-11678-11726"><seg source="#source-11672-11678">畑打</seg></hi><seg source="#source-11726-11776">　　　山畑は月にも打つや真間の里</seg></p>
