        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-22084-22182"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-22084-22138" corresp="#source-22090-22138"><seg source="#source-22084-22090">五月</seg></hi><seg source="#source-22138-22182">　　　大沼や蘆を離るゝ五月雲</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22182-22241" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-22203-22241"><seg source="#source-22203-22241">一笠の首途は安き五月かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-22241-22339"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-22241-22295" corresp="#source-22247-22295"><seg source="#source-22241-22247">短夜</seg></hi><seg source="#source-22295-22339">　　　短夜の麓に余吾の海白し</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22339-22553" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-22374-22406"><seg source="#source-22374-22406">短夜や蓬が上の廿日月</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-22406-22447"><seg source="#source-22406-22447">カンテラや明易き夜の道普請</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-22447-22482"><seg source="#source-22447-22482">短夜を援兵急ぐ山路かな</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-22482-22517"><seg source="#source-22482-22517">短夜や百万遍に朝日さす</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-22555-22665"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-22555-22615" corresp="#source-22564-22615"><seg source="#source-22555-22564">夏の夜</seg></hi><seg source="#source-22615-22665">　　夏の夜を物喰ひ過ぎて寝苦しき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-22665-22769"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-22665-22713" corresp="#source-22668-22713"><seg source="#source-22665-22668">暑</seg></hi><seg source="#source-22713-22769">　　　　午睡さめて尻に夕日の暑さかな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22769-22834" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-22790-22834"><seg source="#source-22790-22834">竹の根の蝉となりたる暑さかな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-22834-22938"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-22834-22882" corresp="#source-22837-22882"><seg source="#source-22834-22837">涼</seg></hi><seg source="#source-22882-22938">　　　　涼しさや魚とる蝦夷がうつろ舟</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-22938-23082" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-22973-23011"><seg source="#source-22973-23011">涼しさや妹が水干立烏帽子</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-23011-23046"><seg source="#source-23011-23046">遺言も涼しき老の枕なか</seg></p>
      </div>
