        <p source="#source-24867-24962"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-24867-24921" corresp="#source-24873-24921"><seg source="#source-24867-24873">帷子</seg></hi><seg source="#source-24921-24962">　　　帷子の洗ひ晒しや三葵</seg></p>
      </div>
