        <p source="#source-24983-25024"><seg source="#source-24983-25024">くらべ合ふ帷子の絵や禿どち</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-25024-25119"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-25024-25072" corresp="#source-25027-25072"><seg source="#source-25024-25027">羅</seg></hi><seg source="#source-25072-25119">　　　　羅を曳くや天女の天津風</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-25119-25223"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-25119-25179" corresp="#source-25128-25179"><seg source="#source-25119-25128">夏帽子</seg></hi><seg source="#source-25179-25223">　　夏帽の紐噛みとめる嵐かな</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-25223-25324"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-25223-25277" corresp="#source-25229-25277"><seg source="#source-25223-25229">日傘</seg></hi><seg source="#source-25277-25324">　　　さしつれて若紫の日傘かな</seg></p>
