          <head n="2" source="#source-27356-27398"><seg source="#source-27356-27362">地理</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-27402-27509"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-27402-27456" corresp="#source-27408-27456"><seg source="#source-27402-27408">夏山</seg></hi><seg source="#source-27456-27483">　　　夏山の城あり</seg><choice source="#source-27483-27489"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-27489-27509">と夜明けたり</seg></p>
      </div>
