        <p source="#source-28596-28691"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-28596-28650" corresp="#source-28602-28650"><seg source="#source-28596-28602">水馬</seg></hi><seg source="#source-28650-28691">　　　水馬一つ処を上りけり</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-28691-28753" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-28712-28753"><seg source="#source-28712-28753">水馬かさなり合うて流れけり</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-28753-28859"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-28753-28807" corresp="#source-28759-28807"><seg source="#source-28753-28759">蝸牛</seg></hi><seg source="#source-28807-28859">　　　でゝ虫の角に夕日の光りかな</seg></p>
      </div>
