        <p source="#source-29888-29986"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-29888-29942" corresp="#source-29894-29942"><seg source="#source-29888-29894">牡丹</seg></hi><seg source="#source-29942-29986">　　　臨幸を乞ひ奉る牡丹かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-29986-30142" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-30021-30068"><seg source="#source-30021-30068">大妓小妓起き出でゝ牡丹日午なり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-30068-30106"><seg source="#source-30068-30106">牡丹画く筆端に紅の雫かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-30144-30248"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-30144-30204" corresp="#source-30153-30204"><seg source="#source-30144-30153">茨の花</seg></hi><seg source="#source-30204-30248">　　茨垣の夏知る一花両花かな</seg></p>
      </div>
