        <p source="#source-30307-30417"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-30307-30367" corresp="#source-30316-30367"><seg source="#source-30307-30316">紫陽花</seg></hi><seg source="#source-30367-30417">　　思ふ事紫陽花の花にうつろひぬ</seg></p>
