        <p source="#source-30619-30720"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-30619-30673" corresp="#source-30625-30673"><seg source="#source-30619-30625">夕顔</seg></hi><seg source="#source-30673-30720">　　　夕顔や馬洗ひ居る武士の妻</seg></p>
