        <p source="#source-30830-30934"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-30830-30884" corresp="#source-30836-30884"><seg source="#source-30830-30836">菖蒲</seg></hi><seg source="#source-30884-30934">　　　村雨の菖蒲分け行く田舟かな</seg></p>
