      <div>
        <p source="#source-31150-31257"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-31150-31204" corresp="#source-31156-31204"><seg source="#source-31150-31156">夏草</seg></hi><seg source="#source-31204-31257">　　　夏草に屋根切り組みし空地かな</seg></p>
