        <p source="#source-37243-37347"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-37243-37297" corresp="#source-37249-37297"><seg source="#source-37243-37249">鳴子</seg></hi><seg source="#source-37297-37347">　　　若君に引かせ参らす鳴子かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-37347-37503" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-37382-37417"><seg source="#source-37382-37417">旅駕の眠り驚く鳴子かな</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-37417-37467"><seg source="#source-37417-37467">こゝろみに毛見の衆も曳く鳴子かな</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-37505-37609"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-37505-37559" corresp="#source-37511-37559"><seg source="#source-37505-37511">毛見</seg></hi><seg source="#source-37559-37609">　　　毛見の僕三径の菊に尿し去る</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-37609-37722"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-37609-37669" corresp="#source-37618-37669"><seg source="#source-37609-37618">柚味噌</seg></hi><seg source="#source-37669-37722">　　柚子味噌の釜も併せて喰らひけり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-37722-37825"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-37722-37782" corresp="#source-37731-37782"><seg source="#source-37722-37731">天長節</seg></hi><seg source="#source-37782-37825">　　年々に天長節の日和かな</seg></p>
      </div>
