        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-37892-37987"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-37892-37946" corresp="#source-37898-37946"><seg source="#source-37892-37898">初嵐</seg></hi><seg source="#source-37946-37987">　　　初嵐御館の小門人叩く</seg></p>
      </div>
