      <div>
        <p source="#source-38040-38132"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-38040-38094" corresp="#source-38046-38094"><seg source="#source-38040-38046">秋風</seg></hi><seg source="#source-38094-38132">　　　税苛し莨畑の秋の風</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-38132-38285" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-38167-38211"><seg source="#source-38167-38211">秋風や黄楊の小櫛の歯をあらみ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38211-38249"><seg source="#source-38211-38249">両刀を抜けば竹なり秋の風</seg></p>
