      <div>
        <p source="#source-38287-38394"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-38287-38341" corresp="#source-38293-38341"><seg source="#source-38287-38293">秋雨</seg></hi><seg source="#source-38341-38394">　　　秋雨や手燭ふり照らす不入の間</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38394-38498"><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-38394-38454" corresp="#source-38403-38454"><seg source="#source-38394-38403">秋の空</seg></hi><seg source="#source-38454-38498">　　秋の空我れに鳥往き鳥返る</seg></p>
      </div>
